# The whole runtime/ tree is generated by `bun run setup`: its own
# node_modules (installed by a `bun install` scoped to this directory, never
# the repo root — see runtime/package.json) plus every downloaded model
# weight/auxiliary file (issue #724 W8: this repo ships NO weights).
runtime/node_modules
runtime/bun.lock
runtime/models/
*.onnx
*.pb
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.gguf
*.safetensors
